source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-22
observed: A digit before the caret blocks the superscript pair, so Jira renders it literally and jiro stays silent.
-- input.jira --
{{2^10}}
-- rendered.html --
<p><tt>2^10</tt></p>
-- want.md --
`2^10`
-- warnings.json --
[]
